  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustaining and Accelerating Primary Health Care In Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To improve the functionality of primary health care units, reducing health inequalities, and  increasing domestic financing  for health to sustain and accelerate the pace of improvement in adolescent, maternal and child health in Ethiopia. This will be achieved  through the Sustainable Development Goals Performance Fund, which will provide essential medicines, and  improve the readiness of primary health care units and skills of primary health care staff to provide quality health services. The programme will also provide technical assistance for effective implementation of the National Health Financing Strategy to increase domestic financing for health, refine and scale-up the Ethiopian Health Insurance systems, and to develop and implement a Public Private Partnership Strategy to improve health outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
